                                                "sense_id": "fc64fb75-a9ae-3c3a-bc0c-71f7fb98a751",
                                                "text": "Omens thicken upon us […] Next, the stumbling of the King whenas he went upon the poop of the long ship which bare us on this voyage to these islands."
